{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "521310c7bdda702bf88aa6bc85436e4d264b71f98f43e88955a0e63c3476afc9", "ja": "リアルタイム？　199X", "zh": "实时？199X", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c0bc69ff9db9e0b2a2bcc9cf69a9e7ca04b8a505a48ad8dedd84f0b65e2c9507", "ja": "劇場でプチ合宿をする事になった一同。一方\nプロデューサーは、仕事の休憩中……と、突\n然辺りが光に包まれる。そこに海美が現れ、\n『劇場の魂』と名乗り、劇場をタイムスリッ\nプさせたと告げる。", "zh": "众人决定在剧场进行小型合宿。另一方面，制作人正在工作休息中……就在这时，突\n然被四周的光芒包围。海美出现在那里，自称“剧场的灵魂”，并告知大家她让剧场穿\n越了时空。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d8c7d59c77d9d7559eed008c3d46436196571697ac7202c078433b34dcf1a00d", "ja": "（今日から、新ユニットの特訓が始まる……\n劇場でのプチ合宿だ！）", "zh": "（新组合的特训从今天开始……是在剧场进行的小型合宿！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2dccb8d31b2d187361b831367739d914e80b48dd87aa00e4314bc418f7f9298c", "ja": "みんなで劇場に一泊して集中レッスン……。\nうん、特訓ってカンジがするよ！", "zh": "大家一起在剧场住上一晚进行集中特训……\n嗯，很有特训的感觉呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "c1ca2593d68cde8f765cb84be46f541e4b8f17d870288264c52c42938ebaa552", "ja": "劇場でお泊り会だもんネ！\nワタシ、楽しみで仕方なかったヨ～♪", "zh": "毕竟要在剧场举办过夜会嘛！\n我可是期待得不得了哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "0a97a2fd166ae96664678546f64b8be2c70efab162997dfc491952e5d63c3839", "ja": "私も私も！　好きなだけダンスレッスンして～♪\n夜は、枕投げして！", "zh": "我也是我也是！想跳多久舞都行～♪\n晚上再来枕头大战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "ad2eb1aecf7f43cb14e5b762b85ce36dca584dd5f1f950fe655af9efd501e66f", "ja": "こーら！　お泊り会じゃなくて、\nプチ合宿だからね。勘違いしないように！", "zh": "喂——！这不是留宿会，而是小型集训。可别搞错了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "b7da9599b4554b7ef72be723443848b1974099a02497cc293400cfb908eb1c18", "ja": "あ、そうだった。でも、のりさんの買い物袋に\nお菓子たくさん入ってたような……？", "zh": "啊，对哦。不过，我好像看到典子姐的购物袋里装了好多零食……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "4a7cc83ecdfdb2224c8e9298b09dc1fa8ef6f9dd77b420b98a1970cd2aec1188", "ja": "うっ、見られてた……！　あ、あれはほら、\n夕飯のお惣菜も入ってて、あくまで計画性のある……。", "zh": "呜，被看到了……！那、那个你看，里面也装着晚饭的熟菜，只是单纯地比较有计划……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "5d96e94c26d551ff1a6f531a707be778566c5019aa86be3fd92e003f07fd1259", "ja": "今日はママンと作ったお菓子も持ってきたヨ！\nキンジンってお菓子♪　新作だヨ、ノリコ～♪", "zh": "今天还带来了和妈妈一起做的点心哟！\n是叫“金金”的点心♪新品哟，纪子～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "0565715564a78ea398f467ffb2d8b421a107b77ecabb61087828fa6de74fbb8a", "ja": "うっ！　そ、それは気になる……！", "zh": "唔！那、那可真让人好奇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "e69214bbf84cf2a144a5c475f5d20e909d879d1b66fec68c94b6290d63f756f3", "ja": "でしょでしょ！\nあとで、のりさんも一緒に食べようね♪", "zh": "对吧对吧！\n等会儿也和典子姐一起吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ef00f8640fe58e5c0b5dcebe1cc51ac40a92fb406afa1b175d21e1c406a023c6", "ja": "けど{$P$}、平気なの？\n劇場に泊まっちゃったりして。", "zh": "不过，{$P$}，真的没关系吗？要是就这么住在剧场里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "68d789a726073c70af4bfb5e2313c83eaa5cdc8d31a90e2a40c4fc0465b324bb", "ja": "大丈夫。劇場は休演日だし、\n社長の許可も取ってるから。", "zh": "没问题。剧场今天休演，\n而且我也得到社长的许可了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e56a84b2b11adaffad0783a4726402e03064b0b09bb5054a432cc134e8d9099e", "ja": "時間はたっぷりある。朝から夜まで、\n全員でとことんやってみてくれ。", "zh": "时间充裕。从早到晚，\n大家尽情去做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2a19dc9c47ec7fa1828337a1e19026286a53262890cb1f0bab64ab83adafc8f5", "ja": "そっか……わかった。\n思いっきりやってみるよ！", "zh": "这样啊……知道了。\n我会尽情试试看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6f1de89941830132b121b8f7d88eac2eeaffc4362c68075fca77d74a50903e18", "ja": "よし、それじゃあプチ合宿開始だ。\n万が一トラブルが発生したら、すぐ報告すること！", "zh": "好，那么小型集训就开始了。\n万一发生意外，要立刻汇报！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "4588682f7274b6bead5721694c7f892eaf18a7aa0d2041ab85899f211d50499f", "ja": "ハ～イ！", "zh": "嗨～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8bfc9ae9a7fc6e6dc51acbd5f77f9a7620c99357fc80b6f9e5969b89de379567", "ja": "（さて、今日はずっと劇場にいられるな。\n今のうちに、書類仕事を片付けておこう！）", "zh": "（好了，今天可以一直待在剧场里。\n趁现在，先把文书工作处理完吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2ba5e86b6771001ea8bb36c2950451e2f2e4e4363a54ddc643c133d3ac403afa", "ja": "（ある程度片付いたけど……だいぶかかったな。\nちょっと休憩して、外の空気でも吸おう）", "zh": "（总算处理得差不多了……不过花了不少时间啊。稍微休息一下，去外面呼吸点新鲜空气吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "56919c2ccb7755580c66eb5f5c7be305bf7a31cf166e25e10f26b503e4c19a21", "ja": "ん？　なんだ、今のすごい光は……あ、あれ？\nいつの間に、劇場の外に出たんだっけ？", "zh": "嗯？刚才那道强光是怎么回事……咦，奇怪？\n我怎么不知不觉就走到剧场外面了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "32b7f9a1194020148f4eaf617d812c428229fa5b4037432c10599a155742741d", "ja": "あら？　こんにちは。\n{$P$}。", "zh": "咦？你好。\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "184bec455a484c6b85e26ca7e0221766a492f29747188d5ebacdb8dc8786d9e1", "ja": "え？　……海美、だよな？\nレッスン中なのに、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？……是海美吧？\n明明还在练习，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "a4773d1805cb9d7ac44c9583a30ca50875b9cd4b4c62f2706c2069c47d4a8297", "ja": "ええ。練習がうまくいったかどうか、\n確認をしにきたの。", "zh": "嗯，我是来确认一下训练进行得顺不顺利的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "289acd16950705fb69d7c75ee8b05f2e7c0888ba4cb834ae94ec79aa5b31feff", "ja": "海美ちゃんも外気に当たりたがっていて、\nちょうどよかったから。", "zh": "因为海美也想出来呼吸一下新鲜空气，正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "148086dfaf513542bffe6ece649df75d8f06dab06e66e39de6bdbebc226b7fa7", "ja": "海美ちゃん？　……ん？　あれ？　なんだか劇場が、\nいつもと違う雰囲気になっているような……？", "zh": "海美？……嗯？咦？总觉得剧场的氛围，好像和往常不太一样……?", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "dea3f776dc25176e8ad304987ba98832f42de95ebf7f557a672e117e31bb8404", "ja": "周囲が古めかしいというか、妙に閑散として……\nえっ！？", "zh": "周围显得很有年代感，而且异常冷清……\n呃！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "5b8ef42f7c4aa0083ca4dc034ca732e0b598403404fc295cf6a979f56d0e2853", "ja": "どうやら、成功したみたいね。……劇場の中に\n戻りましょう、{$P$}？", "zh": "看来似乎成功了呢。……我们回剧场里去吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "bd528fab28ebb932e15e39d71d5c307486d75e7fbd40caac6098865cd79b13fb", "ja": "ほら。新聞の日付を見て。", "zh": "你看，看看报纸上的日期。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5b2808bb4706b42378de9a8383d491ae82d5ee93cb6be8d97925253692f0c0c7", "ja": "な……なんで、新聞の日付が1990年代なんだ？\nしかも、古新聞じゃなくて新しい……！？", "zh": "这……这报纸上的日期怎么会是1990年代的？\n而且还不是旧报纸，是新的……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "e5fa42cb86fa145979448a22d452ad2bc90f69bbfab961d9eec10561fdcf225e", "ja": "簡単よ。つまり、劇場が1990年代に\nタイムスリップしたということ。わかった？", "zh": "很简单。也就是说，剧场穿越到了1990年代。明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "19da86f90ba058798d64d1d0ab14bea2fa3698a76ccd30102d1042f314503dec", "ja": "タイムスリップ！？\nいや、まさか、そんな……！", "zh": "穿越时空！？\n不，怎么可能，怎么会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "22edc629ee9d5ad2704c846df086a4414279c8ae07e07748548c6a1b78672a15", "ja": "タイムスリップ、信じてもらえないとは。\nせっかく成功させたのに。", "zh": "都不相信我穿越时空啊。\n我好不容易才成功的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "35272f512b1238a2f1f830886fe7e5fda1132c8b4a9b787ec37f55c9d1b30574", "ja": "海美がタイムスリップを……？\n……いや、海美じゃないな……？", "zh": "海美穿越时空了……？\n……不，不是海美吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "2207b777aa15f30bd212ad94e1f77e9bddd08921272343b083901896d68f7ec4", "ja": "ふふっ。これで気付く？", "zh": "呵呵，这样就能发现了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "dc58906b18712b6fe323d71d11aedb1db222d90060ce3e11a88068cc2351fb88", "ja": "うわっ！？　この朋花みたいなプレッシャー……！\n覚えがあるぞ。確か……。", "zh": "哇！？这股像朋花一样的压迫感……！\n我记得这种感觉。应该是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_1038", "source_sha256": "e475f5538a9b04d6d824d6d09fb6cb6607601356b13bcc9906a16eca945cc244", "ja": "劇場の魂！", "zh": "剧场之魂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9b4688ebd9febeba41436e20c94b980faffaff1c85be79f92353e7e7fbc3a8a2", "ja": "もしかして……劇場の魂！？", "zh": "难道说……剧场之魂！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "f0343b83fa65156f80d0f2487b5dcc3baa94033f334cb9848d8d898fb0d08bfd", "ja": "ええ、そう。私は、765プロライブ劇場の魂。\nみんなの夢のカケラが集まって生まれた存在……。", "zh": "对，就是这样。我是765专业演出剧场的灵魂。\n是由大家梦想的碎片汇聚而成的存在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2002_029umi", "source_sha256": "af1f300f25ac6481915b904f132e7a462ce647d1b837e6fdff749794ec7cf8d8", "ja": "タイムスリップの練習をしていたの。\nうまくいったみたいでよかった。", "zh": "我刚才在练习穿越时空。\n看来顺利成功了，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2003_p", "source_sha256": "68786e17dd7895a3ff1c7f817c3466f6130c306507fcebace402fc831971ef73", "ja": "練習？\nそういえば、さっきもそんなような事を……。", "zh": "练习？说起来，刚才好像也说过类似的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2004_029umi", "source_sha256": "1681d79b8127e53f03ca6be3360f9c66eff88289773a077afdd777b0d0b4b8dc", "ja": "私……765プロのアイドル達には、この劇場だけで\n公演をしていてほしいの。永遠にね。", "zh": "我……希望765制作人旗下的偶像们，只在这座剧场里\n演出。永远如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2005_029umi", "source_sha256": "429778e37cc05310eccfa2d6ca48ac6fd49df9510c05c910512056692dc679c1", "ja": "なら、劇場の方を移動させればいいんじゃないかって。\nやってみると、案外簡単だったわ。", "zh": "那不如把剧场移动起来不就好了。\n没想到一试，意外地简单呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2006_p", "source_sha256": "7fa9a28ee70f6b4210dfdfa0da59d394ef9c424fc24db2a3f4ee0a24bee0fc63", "ja": "そ、それで劇場をタイムスリップさせたと？\nちょっと……いや、ものすごく困るんだけど……。", "zh": "所、所以你就让剧场穿越时空了？\n这下……不，是非常伤脑筋啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2007_029umi", "source_sha256": "7c2857491cab90f9ac08a21f81cd3d787b964773ce0efb9137976e5500665796", "ja": "あら、アナタにとっても悪くない話だと思うんだけど。\n新しいユニットが、特訓中でしょう？", "zh": "哎呀，我觉得这对你来说也不是什么坏事吧。\n新组合不是正在特训中吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2008_p", "source_sha256": "90aaa5bf4817b72f5129cab8a9fca488bc2b58ff083b4883c60f65be7cbc1404", "ja": "まさか……だから90年代に？", "zh": "难道说……所以才来到90年代？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2009_029umi", "source_sha256": "df528ac95270c04343c94ad336b6db4441426e5e2a7e9e4fd5369eedb5b50432", "ja": "この時代なら、解決の糸口も見つかるはず。\nこれも765プロのアイドルを思ってのこと……。", "zh": "在这个时代的话，应该也能找到解决问题的线索。\n\n这也是替765制作人的偶像们着想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2010_029umi", "source_sha256": "94a6523e7f20536a2982306d4bc4262c7eb8afd6e35dff86c07ebbda0a1fd53b", "ja": "{$P$}なら、ユニットのみんなを\n正しく導いてあげて。出来なければ……承知しない。", "zh": "如果是{$P$}的话，就好好地\n引导组合的大家吧。要是做不到……我可饶不了你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2011_029umi", "source_sha256": "4eb9f46cf09e548b5491529f1bfffc3ed95fa0f7db794842a18de1bf556c9a25", "ja": "それじゃ……またね。", "zh": "那么……再见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2012_p", "source_sha256": "ca0c8d3acbd016ab1a5f0dccf0af03bbc34d24c1d06cf4d28b84abd2c91690d3", "ja": "（劇場の魂はそう言うと、眠ってしまった。\nひとまず、海美が無事みたいで何よりだけど……）", "zh": "（剧场之魂说完这些后，就睡着了。\n总之，海美好像没事，这就再好不过了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_02_2013_p", "source_sha256": "83ea43efff7b1e6937857e9b8c1cad676467099a1d38165e04f0a66971432891", "ja": "（今度、劇場の魂用の神棚を作るべきか……？\nと、とにかく大変な事になったぞ！）", "zh": "（下次是不是该给剧场之魂做个神龛呢……？\n不、不管怎么说，事情变得不得了了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
